-- CAPABILITY ---------------- errors/cap_ceiling_4.march

`main` performs IO but declares no grant. The program reaches `IO.Mut`; a `main` with no `needs` clause and no module `needs` line is granted nothing. [cap_grant]
help: request what `main` actually needs —
        fn main() needs IO.Mut
or everything with `needs IO`.
`forge fix` can apply this.

21 |   fn main() do
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^


    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

21 -   fn main() do
21 +   fn main() needs IO.Mut do

    run `march --explain cap_grant`



